  (text "4. TOUCH KEYS (AT42QT1011), ONE PER OUTLET" (at 267.9700 36.8300 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 14a1cff8-0d68-4625-8f1b-1f5d95219d82))
  (text "Cs 10 nF and Rs 4.7k are starting values; tune on the EVT faceplate. OUT is active high: board_evt_c6 sets touch polarity.\nSYNC/MODE strapped high by a 0R: Fast mode (~1 ms between bursts). Low-power mode (strap low) sleeps ~80 ms per burst and feels slow." (at 267.9700 40.6400 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5a74d5ce-2c37-4edd-8d27-34ed22a08438))
